 please randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nIn an amusement park, dad and son Xiao Chen are in line to ride the roller coaster. The roller coaster has 30 seats but only 20 people are sitting. Dad tells his son, \"Most people choose to sit in the front row, a small part in the back row, almost no one sits in the middle.\" The son counts and finds that only 2 people are sitting in the middle.\n\n[Question]\nAfter Xiao Chen counts, does he guess that people are sitting in the back row?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. After Xiao Chen counts, he guesses that 10 people are sitting in the back row.\nB. After Xiao Chen counts, he guesses that 18 people are sitting in the back row.\nC. After Xiao Chen counts, he guesses that 12 people are sitting in the back row.\nD. After Xiao Chen counts, he guesses that 15 people are sitting in the back row.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":7,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0059108750862262895,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af6818af4429d1fd72f82b4","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794539914686,"createTime":"2026-11-13 11:18:34","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"1833121ab8854285b6264f772cee49f4"}